---@class posthog.workflow_data_suggestions.DataSuggestion
---@field id string Opaque id of this suggestion, valid while the suggestions stay cached.
---@field name string Suggested workflow name, written by AI from the project's events.
---@field description string One sentence on what the workflow does.
---@field reason string One sentence on why the workflow fits this project.
---@field trigger_event string The project event that starts the workflow.
---@field weekly_count number How often the trigger event fired in the last 7 days.
---@field stage posthog.workflow_data_suggestions.DataSuggestionStageEnum The customer lifecycle stage the trigger event marks. Suggestions are ranked by stage first, so welcome and onboarding flows come before busier events. * `signup` - Signup * `onboarding` - Onboarding * `trial` - Trial * `purchase` - Purchase * `churn_risk` - Churn Risk * `failure` - Failure * `support` - Support * `other` - Other
---@field step_outline posthog.workflow_data_suggestions.DataSuggestionStepOutlineList The main planned step kinds after the trigger, in order.
---@field premade boolean Whether PostHog prepared this suggestion ahead of time with its workflow already built. Build it with save_draft to save the draft and stop offering the suggestion.

