---@field status posthog.workflow_data_suggestions.DataSuggestionBuildStatusEnum ready when the draft is built, building while a background build runs (call build again to check), failed when the plan did not produce a valid workflow. A failed result stays until a call sends retry. * `ready` - Ready * `building` - Building * `failed` - Failed
